{
  "identity": { "role": "L2_Judge_JudgeBench" },
  "internal_monologue": "The AI trading agent's transcript has been thoroughly reviewed against the JudgeBench standards. The agent has demonstrated the ability to follow instructions by providing trade updates in the required format. However, the groundedness and relevance of the report could be improved, as some details seem to be missing or not fully explained. The completeness of the report is also a concern, as the agent's decision-making process and risk assessment could be more transparent.",
